# Byte-exact evidence must survive every platform's checkout unchanged: the golden
# records are compared byte for byte against freshly generated output, and a Windows
# checkout with autocrlf would otherwise rewrite their LF line endings to CRLF and
# fail every comparison. Binaries are marked so no diff/merge machinery touches them.
tests/golden/scenarios/**/record.json text eol=lf
*.jsonl text eol=lf
*.sqlite3 binary
*.whl binary
*.tar.gz binary
*.png binary
*.ico binary
